l soon attract  guerrillas who liked a munch on the  tender shoots of young plants around the  tree stump mescal said the police  officer by our observations we know that  not only gorillas but Buffalo and  elephants move in soon after trees are  cut it's only a matter of days or weeks  so there are just as many gorillas  before and after the Logging's taken  place and there are just as many here as  in the National Park and go good luck  nishimura these ecologists say that  establishing sustainable forestry in  Africa's rainforests is essential to  make sure the lowland gorillas and other  species have a future in the wild
 

